Do not allow an unexplained `NullReferenceException`.

Before using:

```csharp
_reader.GetCell(each.Name)
```

store and validate the result.

Example concept:

```csharp
Cell sourceCell = _reader.GetCell(each.Name);

if (sourceCell == null)
{
    // Handle or report the actual missing field clearly.
}
```

Do the same for:

```csharp
_columns[each.Column]
```

The fix should avoid silently ignoring real mapping errors.

If a required mapping cannot be found, provide enough information to identify:

```text
which field
which validation column
which mapping failed
```

Do not leave only the generic:

```text
Object reference not set to an instance of an object.
```

